note: trial-071b showed the size, this time run it on a comparable problem to trial 072. First attempt at this run_name (checkpoint_mode=final, 6 epochs, push_to_hub=false) reported success but the resulting kelmoir/cafa6-esm@trial-075 branch turned out to contain stale/mixed files (a leftover adapter_config.json/adapter_model.safetensors alongside the real model.safetensors - push_checkpoint()'s upload_folder() call doesn't clear a branch before uploading, so old content from an earlier attempt at this branch name can persist). Rerun below at the full 8-epoch/6000-train/1000-val budget (matching trial-072 exactly), with --run-diagnostic and --push-to-hub set this time, superseding the first attempt.

